keywords:
  - random matrix theory
  - Riemann zeta function
  - L-functions
  - Katz-Sarnak
  - phase-locked loop
  - Farey sequence
  - level statistics
  - GUE
  - quantum chaos
  - large language models
  - weight spectra
  - pre-registration
  - explicit formula
  - Selberg trace formula
  - prime spectroscopy

